WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:34.920
Having finished the study in Guangzhou,

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:36.950
I plan to go to a new place

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.730
for a new world of food.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.820
In this vast country,

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.930
there must be many amazing food

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.020
that I haven't seen.

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.010
So refreshing.

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:57.740
Mao, you may come and wash.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.160
Mao, what are you doing?

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:03.930
If someone sees this,

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.410
he will recognize that

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:06.390
I'm a super chef.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.030
So...

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:08.330
You don't want people to know?

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:09.420
I want...

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.480
I want to go back to zero!

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.780
I want to study cooking like I'm a new hand.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:20.040
Genius Boy Chef?! Silang?

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:28.970
So hot!

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.740
We shouldn't have headed southward.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.910
We should go to Shanghai

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:33.770
or Beijing.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.150
Look, mao.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.240
What?

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:42.790
Is he sleeping?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.070
He looks so weird.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.170
Hey, you okay?

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:49.420
Wake up!

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:50.980
You okay?

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.050
Wake up.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:54.880
He woke up.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:55.910
You alright?

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:57.750
I'm starving.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:04.400
Big stuffed buns!

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:05.530
I'll eat them.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.260
Are you crazy?

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.930
I'm starving.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:24.840
I picked some fruits

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:26.110
and fried them with vegetables.

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:28.060
And put them on cooked meat.

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.270
It should taste good.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.500
You may give him some stinky meat.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:32.100
I mean it.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.580
I'm full!

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:34.370
So full.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.240
You are not bad.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.380
Well, I'll take you as my student.

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.630
Since you are a cook,

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.080
you might have heard that

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.890
there was a youngest talent in history who

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.550
passed the biggest challenge in

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.550
Super Chef test held in every four year?

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.100
You know that?

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.600
Of course!

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:55.970
I tell you a secret.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:56.720
Actually...

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.580
What?

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.570
That talent…

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.040
I tell you the truth,

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.660
(Super)

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.720
is me!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.830
It's normal that you are so surprised.

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:13.030
You didn't expect that

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.360
a super chef will be here, right?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.170
And I'm willing to

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.210
take you two as my students.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:20.200
What are you talking about?

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:20.870
The real...

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:21.500
My name is Mao.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:22.180
What about you?

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.650
My name is Silang.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.150
As long as you learn from me for three years,

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.740
I believe you can be as good as me.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:28.690
Silang.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:29.940
What a strange name.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.430
We can't be late.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.950
Or we will make those people greeting us worry.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:36.150
Come with me!

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:38.270
Lady Bun, you can come with us.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.060
You call me Lady Bun?

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:41.760
Don't forget to put out the fire.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.910
I have a name!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.580
My name is Meili!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:50.050
Strange.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.150
This town is so deserted.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.240
Strange!

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.730
I come back as a super chef!

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.730
You still talk about this?

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.580
I have written them letters!

00:04:58.630 --> 00:04:59.960
I said I have completed the two-year training

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:00.540
and become a super chef,

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:01.710
so I came back.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.270
But why don't they greet me?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.970
Stop! Please stop!

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.560
My wife and kid have nothing to do with this.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.010
Anyone help me?

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:15.670
Excuse me.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:17.070
Don't squeeze in!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:22.920
So big!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:24.660
Next, Sanxiao Restaurant.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:26.830
Magistrate.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.340
The cook made bird's nest soup for you.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:30.610
Soup.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.360
Horrible!

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:40.950
You people...

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.890
Magistrate Bao.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.910
Close the restaurant!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.090
Put all the chefs into jail!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.270
You can’t do this!

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.660
Help me!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.420
That's ridiculous!

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.120
It's all your fault!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.160
Your food are so bad!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.170
That's why I become so thin!

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:20.810
Yes, you are right.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:22.510
Listen, all of you!

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:23.980
Tomorrow

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.110
you have to make

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.470
dishes that suit Magistrate Bao!

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:27.790
Who is the cook tomorrow?

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:28.840
Caigen Restaurant.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.120
You!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.040
Caigen Restaurant.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.250
Mother?

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:43.790
That man is the new magistrate from Beijing?

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:44.790
Yes.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:45.920
He disagreed with the policy in the central government,

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:48.580
so he was sent to the south.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:49.880
Since he came here,

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.450
he demands good food every day.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.070
He closes the restaurant he is unsatisfied with.

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:55.300
Even the chef's family

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.790
have to be behind bars.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.510
Because of him,

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.230
this place becomes deserted.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.640
Evil!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.660
Doing bad things in the name of cooking,

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:04.330
unbelievable!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:05.830
Fortunately,

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:06.770
our young master

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.110
comes back as a super chef.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.070
We have nothing to worry about.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.890
You are so great.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.720
You must have suffered a lot.

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:16.780
Nothing!

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.410
We count on you, Young Master.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:19.590
This challenge,

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.140
I don't know what to do as an old cook.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.830
For all people in this place,

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.040
you have to

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.300
make the dishes that

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:27.440
win his heart!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.140
I'll do it!

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:32.000
I will use my skill to save my mother

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.150
and other people in town.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.660
Great!

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:40.940
The fire is small.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.210
Bring some woods.

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:42.890
Okay.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:44.420
Bring me oil!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.510
Okay!

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:46.750
Where's the onion?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:47.620
Hurry up!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.030
Okay!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:50.690
Why do I have to do this

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.030
is such a place?

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.250
His father passed away long ago.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.740
Because his mother is a Japanese,

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.460
Silang was bullied very often.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:01.930
So he promised to become a super chef

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.800
to impress those who bullied him.

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:05.990
So he left home to study cooking.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:12.700
Okay, now,

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.360
we just have to steam it.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.270
Well done.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.810
Please try this.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.390
What is this?

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.320
This is called onigiri.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:24.080
Silang loves it.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:25.040
Onigiri?

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.840
It looks special.

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:28.950
It is also called Musubi in Japan.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.310
To eat food outdoors,

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:32.260
we will use cooked rice

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.290
and make them into a ball.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.220
I'll have a try.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:39.820
The taste...

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.050
What's wrong?

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.130
It's done!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:48.880
Steamed meat buns.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.050
Yes, my specialty!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.750
Have a try.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.220
Please try it, Madame.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.100
Okay.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.140
It's hot. Be careful!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.840
Let me have a try.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.330
Well, taste good, right?

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.590
The flavors are gone.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.600
Listen, it tastes...

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.200
I forgot!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:14.490
Sorry, Master.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.130
I forgot to put the spice.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.150
No wonder.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.010
I feel something is missing.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.800
I should use sweetened vinegar

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.030
and king oyster mushrooms with Chinese-pepper.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:36.200
Master, the source's ratio

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.240
is sweetened vinegar of three to mushroom of one, right?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:50.270
Done!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:51.880
I did as master told me.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.250
Have a try.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:09:59.960
Delicious!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.180
(Mother and son are amazed)
This is the best meat bun

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.660
(Mother and son are amazed)
I have in my life.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:09.860
Master, what do you think?

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:13.880
You are doing

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:15.780
better.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.000
Of course.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:17.980
Mao is the real...

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:20.000
It hurts!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.480
Okay, we can use the bun

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:23.800
to feed that fat pig!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.190
Come on, Silang!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.890
I have such a great student.

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.970
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:46.750
So hot!

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.180
Caigen Restaurant, come forward.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:57.290
Yes.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.290
This time it may be fine?

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:06.900
Yes.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.110
Silang is

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.640
a super chef.

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:10.510
Mao.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.700
Don't worry.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:12.700
Show Magistrate

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.470
your food.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:15.340
Yes.

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.300
Magistrate,

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:21.980
today's first dish

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.780
is Caigen Restaurant's meat buns.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.260
Meat buns?

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:25.950
Please have a try.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:38.480
I'm not gonna eat this!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.310
Why?

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.460
You!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.660
Useless!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.480
Silang!

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:52.620
Silang!

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:55.050
Wake up!

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:57.410
Are you okay?

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.470
I'm fine.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.320
Why you all cannot make

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:04.560
the food I want?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:05.510
Why?

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.300
Even Super Chef's dish

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:08.250
couldn't satisfy him.

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.350
Super Chef?

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.690
Who is the Super Chef?

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:13.700
Silang.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.460
After three year's training,

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.450
he became a super chef and came back.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.640
Silang, show him your badge.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:25.200
(Super)

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:34.290
That's not the badge of Super Chef.

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:35.880
I'm an experienced food lover.

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:36.750
You think I haven't seen

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.820
the badge of Super Chef?

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.750
That's fake!

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:48.510
Is that true?

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:49.900
You said you are Super Chef.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.070
You lie!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:52.190
Silang.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:53.940
Sorry, mother,

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:56.580
I want to impress everyone

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.430
with the badge.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:12:59.490
So I...

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.290
Silang.

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:01.680
You stupid boy!

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:03.770
You didn't make the food

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.080
that satisfied Magistrate Bao.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.420
You even lied

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.490
and said you are a super chef!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.670
You have to suffer more in jail.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.990
I order you to do hard work in jail.

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.600
I beg you

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:17.790
to forgive him.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.560
He is only a child!

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:20.540
No.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:21.440
Once I've decided something,

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:22.890
I will never change.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:24.050
No!

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:25.730
Mao?

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:26.740
So weird.

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:28.370
I feel very good about

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.330
that meat bun.

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:31.050
So hot!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.960
Be harder!

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.430
What's wrong

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:35.690
with that meat bun?

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:37.670
Magistrate, please!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:38.470
Forgive him!

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:39.800
What are you doing?

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.450
What should we do, Mao?

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.440
It's much worse than Beijing.

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.240
I hate countryside!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:49.610
Let me go!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.230
You nasty child!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:57.680
Who did that!

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.190
Please let me try again.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.720
This time would you like to give me a chance?

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.310
Who are you?

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.940
I'm the new chef in Caigen Restaurant.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:11.870
I promise that I will

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.000
make the food that satisfies you.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.630
You little kid dare to promise.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.260
Interesting.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:29.400
Since you promised me,

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.810
you may have a try.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.490
But if you fail,

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:35.000
you will face more than prison.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:35.870
You kid.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:37.440
You can believe me.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.580
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.460
Please come here.

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.370
You cannot slip by

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.140
with this exquisite container.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.110
Magistrate, please enjoy.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:10.590
What fried rice?

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:11.570
It's like bird food.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.960
Egg and green onion?

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.630
It's like normal fried rice.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.580
You cannot satisfy me

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.120
with this normal food.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.490
What are these red things?

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.710
Let me have a try first.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:35.630
This...

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:53.040
Do you feel good about the food?

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:55.830
Annoying!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:58.640
How can I know with these little food?

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.400
Go and bring me more!

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:01.810
I want more fried rice!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:02.650
I want more!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:03.220
Silang!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.080
Yes.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:04.560
Meili.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:05.680
Let's see!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:06.940
What are you doing?

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:17.690
This is...

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.590
There is fried rice under the table!

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:29.610
Magistrate!

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:41.440
Troublesome!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.010
Will magistrate use his

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.050
special skill that haven't shown for a long time?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.360
What will happen?

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:16.970
What a weird person?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.720
But why?

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:20.660
Why is magistrate not willing to

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.670
take a bite at all the delicacies,

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.450
but is so crazy for

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.710
this fried rice?

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.740
Magistrate, please have some tea.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:37.790
Magistrate has taken

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.230
this huge basin of fried rice.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.580
Since we left Beijing,

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:49.660
I haven't seen his smile

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:50.460
for a long time.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:51.300
Kid,

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.300
what did you put in the rice?

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.460
Sourness.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:55.090
Sourness?

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:55.710
Yes.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.470
Actually, those dishes

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.880
Could have satisfied Magistrate.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.140
But he's too hot,

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:01.270
so he lost appetite.

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:05.300
I used sourness to improve his appetite.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:06.910
Feeling hot and losing appetite.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.990
It's good for you to notice that.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:09.990
Because I

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.270
grew up in Beijing, which is cool.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.990
I can't stand the hot weather here.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.920
So no matter what those cooks made for me,

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.970
I don't want to eat them.

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:20.830
I just feel annoying.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.030
Magistrate,

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:23.820
what kind of sourness?

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.330
That flavor is

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.350
sucking and stimulating my tongue.

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:30.760
It makes my mouth water.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.320
It strongly shocked my esophagus and stomach

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:35.790
and boosted my appetite.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.650
Combined with lively sour flavor

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:41.590
and sweet-and-salty fried egg,

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.710
that taste

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.950
is so magic!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.370
The energy lost due to hot weather

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:49.080
appears again.

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:51.900
What's that sourness?

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:54.050
Do you mean...

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:54.650
Yes.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:55.650
This thing.

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.410
This is...

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.780
This is called sour plums.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:00.540
Normally we use it as

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.060
medicine.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:03.090
But in Japan,

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.250
it is wrapped in rice

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:06.510
to form a food called onigiri.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:09.370
I tasted it yesterday.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:10.750
Sour plum.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:15.820
This is it!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.350
I removed the pits in the plums,

00:19:17.570 --> 00:19:18.950
chopped them,

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:20.570
and fried them with rice.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:22.590
That's how I made this refreshing fried rice.

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:24.720
These red things

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.700
are sour plums, right?

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.490
It sounds simple.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.620
But you can use the foreign food

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:34.510
you just ate once in a clever way.

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:35.120
No.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:38.490
You can see through what people think.

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:40.720
This cannot be done

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:41.840
by a common chef.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:42.830
I had said that

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.030
he is my No.1 student.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:46.820
You shut up!

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.690
Don't beat me!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.370
You don't have a sense of humor.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:51.600
Mao.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.750
That badge is...

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:01.400
Super Chef!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.340
Super Chef!

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:07.300
No wonder he can make such a great dish.

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:12.060
I have heard you before.

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:13.400
You have passed the test of

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:15.240
Super Chef in Guangzhou for one time.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.630
The youngest Super Chef.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:19.830
Are you Mao?

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.820
I'm satisfied mentally and physically.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.260
Let all the chefs out.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:41.620
Let their restaurants

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.290
open again!

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:57.640
Thank you so much!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.680
Be careful on the road.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:01.200
Thank you.

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:02.730
You should also take care.

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:04.490
Hey!

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:05.710
Why are you standing there?

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:08.350
Silang?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.080
We're going now!

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.950
The sun is going to get down.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.450
He wants to go with us?

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:16.480
Sorry,

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:17.630
I asked him not to but in vain.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:18.320
I know that's troubling.

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:20.120
But please look after him.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.110
I can help you with the luggage.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.450
I'm willing to do anything.

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:27.410
Lady Bun, let me help you.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.450
Stop calling me like that!

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.440
Watch me!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.400
Meili, wait!

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:34.270
When I come back,

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:35.220
I will become

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.150
a real super chef!

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:38.580
Silang, remember!

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.690
Don't cause trouble!

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.410
Stand there!

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:18.693
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.693 --> 00:23:20.316
Now it's the next town.

00:23:20.441 --> 00:23:24.778
I heard that there's a restaurant opened by Master
Jia Xiong, the legendary chef of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:23:24.861 --> 00:23:26.946
What kind of food is waiting for us?

00:23:27.386 --> 00:23:28.990
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.073 --> 00:23:32.327
Super Boobs! Beware of the Beauty Sweet Trap

00:23:32.452 --> 00:23:33.619
It will definitely be interesting!
